OL,4,BAustralia set to drop Lyon for first   
OL,5,BNew Zealand Test                       
OL,6,GAustralia are set to drop off-spinner  
OL,7,GNathan Lyon for the first Test against 
OL,8,GNew Zealand, with uncapped Corey       
OL,9,GRocchiccioli expected to be named in   
OL,10,Gthe squad.                             
OL,12,FThe omission of Lyon for the Test in   
OL,13,FPerth from 9-13 December is not        
OL,14,Fthought to be linked to the sandpaper  
OL,15,Fcontroversy.                           
OL,17,FLyon was part of the Australia XI in   
OL,18,FCape Town in 2018 and, three years     
OL,19,Flater, joined his fellow bowlers in    
OL,20,Freleasing a statement denying          
OL,21,Finvolvement in the cheating plot.      
